# Iron Spider, Stark Upgrade's "{2}, Remove two +1/+1 counters from among artifacts you control: Draw a card." On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Spider (three Moxen) and a free
# Ornithopter. On turn 3 there are no counters yet, so the ability can't be paid although the mana is there; the Spider taps for a counter on itself and on the Ornithopter,
# then the draw is paid with exactly {2} (the pool is empty after) and one counter from each of the two artifacts: both are gone and Bot1 draws exactly one card.

